{"change_summary":"Confirmed the tracked carbonate/source-water/substrate files already carried the required provenance metadata, then fixed the remaining review gaps by updating docs/PROVENANCE_STATUS.md to accurately reflect the shipped confidence tiers, add an explicit code-resident carbonate-constants section, and add a habitat/biofilter scaling section. Added regression tests in crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs that lock the shipped source-water and substrate metadata coverage in place so the summary cannot drift again.","outstanding_risks":["soft_acidic.toml and ro_like.toml still do not carry per-parameter param_meta entries.","Substrate coverage is still partial: the shipped checks now cover colonizable_area_factor, but other substrate indices and nutrient-charge fields remain unannotated.","Code-resident carbonate constants are now documented and summarized, but they still rely on doc comments plus PROVENANCE_STATUS.md until the project has a dedicated metadata registry for solver constants."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected the tracked chemistry/source-water/substrate files against the review findings and confirmed the missing carbonate/source-water/habitat metadata was already present in the current tree.","order":0,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Updated docs/PROVENANCE_STATUS.md so the source-water table matches the actual confidence tiers, added explicit provenance coverage for code-resident carbonate constants, and added a representative habitat/biofilter scaling section.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Added tank_data regression tests to assert the shipped source-water priority metadata tiers and the shipped substrate colonizable-area metadata.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran formatting and validation for the changed files.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo fmt` completed successfully.","`cargo test -p tank_data` passed with 35 tests green, including `presets::tests::shipped_source_water_priority_metadata_matches_summary` and `presets::tests::shipped_substrate_presets_expose_colonizable_area_metadata`."]}